# Payment Parameters Template
#
# Column Descriptions:
# - Payment_ID: Unique identifier for each payment transaction
# - Source_Institution: ID of institution sending payment
# - Target_Institution: ID of institution receiving payment
# - Amount: Payment value in currency units
# - Priority: Payment priority level (HIGH, NORMAL, LOW)
# - Timestamp: Time of payment submission (HH:MM:SS)
# - Currency: Currency code (USD, EUR, GBP, etc.)
# - Payment_Type: Type of payment system (RTGS, WIRE, ACH, etc.)
#
# Priority Levels:
# - HIGH: Time-critical payments, processed immediately
# - NORMAL: Standard payments, FIFO processing
# - LOW: Deferred payments, processed during low-activity periods
#
# Payment Types:
# - RTGS: Real-Time Gross Settlement (immediate, individual)
# - WIRE: Wire transfer (same-day settlement)
# - ACH: Automated Clearing House (batch processing)
#
# Notes:
# - All amounts must be positive values
# - Timestamps should be in 24-hour format
# - Source and Target institutions must exist in institution_config
